Revision history for Coin::Hnoss

0.009  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->from_string, parsing major-unit strings
         into minor-unit Money using the currency''s exponent. Strict about
         precision: too many decimal digits is an error, never a silent
         round. Options mirror format (decimal_mark, thousands_separator,
         group_size).

0.008  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->format.

0.007_01 2026-11-09
       - Fix Currency::Repository->default: replace invalid `state` with a
         file-scoped lexical.

0.007  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency::Repository.
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency->exponent and ->subunit.

0.006_02 2026-11-09
       - Fix allocate: allocate on |amount| then negate.

0.006  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->allocate.

0.005  2026-11-09
       - Add comparison and predicates to Coin::Hnoss::Money.
       - Overload <=>, ==, !=, <, >, <=, >= to use compare.

0.004_01 2026-11-09
       - Document floor semantics for divide / divide_with_remainder.

0.004  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Exception base class.
       - Add arithmetic to Coin::Hnoss::Money.

0.003  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money (immutable amount + currency value object).

0.002  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency (ISO 4217 code value object).

0.001  2026-11-09
       - Initial skeleton.
